A cozy orange couch floating in a vast cosmic void filled with swirling galaxies and nebulae, with small glowing database cylinders orbiting around it like moons. The couch has a warm, inviting fabric texture with visible cushion stitching. Tiny sparkling data streams flow between the orbiting cylinders in soft blue and gold light trails. The scene has a whimsical Studio Ghibli aesthetic with soft watercolor-style rendering, gentle gradients in deep purples and warm oranges, and a sense of peaceful wonder. Small floating geometric shapes resembling JSON brackets drift lazily through the starfield like cosmic dust motes. The overall mood is playful yet technical, suggesting collaboration and openness in a dreamy, fantastical setting.
